      "content": "For your stakeholders, the pipeline flows from code commit through automated testing, staging, and finally to production. At the commit stage, a simple linting/unit test gate ensures immediate code quality. Before staging, comprehensive integration and end-to-end tests should pass to catch system-level issues. Finally, production deployment requires a manual approval gate, often preceded by canary or blue/green testing for risk mitigation.",
