      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. one more thing—how do we handle the 'unknown unknowns'? like, when something weird happens that isn't caught by the standard tests or sensors, but you can just tell something is wrong with the stability of the environment. how do we account for those sneaky, unexpected issues that slip through the gates?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
